    "Be human. Keep conversations consensual, avoid targeted abuse and threats, and report content that puts people at risk. Safety reports are reviewed by the Echo team and may be retained to protect the community.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Be human. Keep conversations consensual, avoid targeted abuse and threats, and report content that puts people at risk. Safety reports are reviewed by the Echo team and may be retained to protect the community."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sea humano. Mantenga las conversaciones consensuadas, evite abusos y amenazas dirigidas y denuncie contenido que ponga a las personas en riesgo. El equipo de Echo revisa los informes de seguridad y pueden conservarse para proteger a la comunidad."
          }
        }
      }
    },
