    "Echo is a place to talk, create, and share responsibly. You are responsible for what you post, for protecting your account, and for respecting other people’s rights. Do not use Echo to harass, impersonate, exploit, or distribute unlawful content.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Echo is a place to talk, create, and share responsibly. You are responsible for what you post, for protecting your account, and for respecting other people’s rights. Do not use Echo to harass, impersonate, exploit, or distribute unlawful content."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Echo es un lugar para hablar, crear y compartir de manera responsable. Eres responsable de lo que publicas, de proteger tu cuenta y de respetar los derechos de otras personas. No utilice Echo para acosar, suplantar, explotar o distribuir contenido ilegal."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Echo safety will review it": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
